<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><title>New Steam releases that use AI | GameAICheck</title><meta name="description" content="Games released on Steam in the last 60 days that disclose AI-generated content, most-reviewed first."/><link rel="canonical" href="https://gameaicheck.com/lists/new-releases-with-ai"/><meta property="og:title" content="New Steam releases that use AI | GameAICheck"/><meta property="og:description" content="Games released on Steam in the last 60 days that disclose AI-generated content, most-reviewed first."/><meta property="og:url" content="https://gameaicheck.com/lists/new-releases-with-ai"/><meta property="og:site_name" content="GameAICheck"/><meta name="theme-color" content="#171a21"/><meta name="impact-site-verification" value="25bd5fef-d3df-4ab6-9146-5027bd974042"/><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" sizes="48x48"/><link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/favicon-32.png"/><link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="16x16" href="/favicon-16.png"/><link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/apple-touch-icon.png"/><link rel="manifest" href="/site.webmanifest"/><meta property="og:image" content="https://gameaicheck.com/icon-512.png"/><style>
:root {
  /* Steam store palette: one dark theme, like Steam itself */
  color-scheme: dark;
  --bg: #1b2838; --header: #171a21; --panel: #16202d; --soft: #213246; --line: #2a3f5a;
  --ink: #dcdedf; --head: #ffffff; --muted: #9ea8b1; --accent: #66c0f4; --placeholder: #a9c3d9;
  /* white on the button is 5.1:1; Steam's own #1a9fff is 2.8:1 */
  --button: #0b6fc7; --button-hover: #0a62b0; --field: #233c51;
  --ai: #f0a04b; --ai-bg: rgba(240, 160, 75, .12); --clear: #c7d5e0; --clear-bg: rgba(199, 213, 224, .08);
  --flag: #ff8a7d; --flag-bg: rgba(255, 138, 125, .12); --radius: 4px;
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
html { -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; }
body { margin: 0; min-height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; background: var(--bg) linear-gradient(180deg, #1f3247 0, var(--bg) 420px) no-repeat; color: var(--ink);
  font: 16px/1.6 -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif; }
a { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; }
a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
img { max-width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }
.wrap { max-width: 880px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 16px; }
header.site { background: var(--header); box-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, .4); }
header.site .wrap { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; height: 56px; }
.logo { font-weight: 800; color: var(--head); letter-spacing: .02em; white-space: nowrap; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 15px; }
.logo span { color: var(--accent); }
.logo:hover { text-decoration: none; }
.logo { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
.logo img { border-radius: 5px; }
header nav { display: flex; gap: 14px; font-size: 14px; margin-left: auto; }
header nav a { color: var(--muted); text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: .04em; }
header nav a:hover { color: var(--head); text-decoration: none; }
main { padding: 24px 0 56px; flex: 1; }
.skip { position: absolute; left: -9999px; top: 8px; z-index: 20; background: var(--button); color: #fff; padding: 8px 14px; border-radius: var(--radius); }
.skip:focus { left: 16px; }
h1 { font-size: 30px; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0 0 12px; letter-spacing: -.01em; color: var(--head); font-weight: 600; }
h2 { font-size: 15px; margin: 32px 0 12px; color: var(--head); font-weight: 500; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .06em;
  padding-bottom: 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
h3 { font-size: 16px; margin: 20px 0 8px; }
p { margin: 0 0 12px; }
h1, h2, .verdict .head { text-wrap: balance; }
p, li, dd, summary { text-wrap: pretty; }
main p { max-width: 68ch; }
::selection { background: rgba(102, 192, 244, .35); color: var(--head); }
:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: 2px; }
td, .stat, dl.facts dd { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.muted { color: var(--muted); }
.small { font-size: 14px; }
.panel { background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 18px; }
.verdict { border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 18px 20px; border: 1px solid; margin: 16px 0 8px; }
.verdict.ai { background: var(--ai-bg); border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ai) 35%, transparent); }
.verdict.clear { background: var(--clear-bg); border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--clear) 35%, transparent); }
.verdict.flag { background: var(--flag-bg); border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--flag) 35%, transparent); }
.verdict .head { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 750; margin-bottom: 6px; }
.verdict.ai .head { color: var(--ai); } .verdict.clear .head { color: var(--clear); } .verdict.flag .head { color: var(--flag); }
.chips { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; margin: 10px 0 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
.chip { font-size: 13px; padding: 2px 10px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--soft); border: 1px solid var(--line); white-space: nowrap; }
.chip.live { background: var(--ai); color: #fff; border-color: var(--ai); }
blockquote { margin: 0; padding: 14px 16px; background: var(--soft); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); white-space: pre-wrap; }
table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 15px; }
th, td { text-align: left; padding: 10px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); vertical-align: top; }
th { font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 600; }
.game-head { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 16px; }
.game-head img { border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid var(--line); }
dl.facts { display: grid; grid-template-columns: max-content 1fr; gap: 4px 16px; margin: 0; font-size: 15px; }
dl.facts dt { color: var(--muted); }
dl.facts dd { margin: 0; }
.search { display: flex; gap: 8px; position: relative; }
.search input { flex: 1; min-width: 0; font: inherit; padding: 12px 14px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); background: var(--field); color: var(--head); }
.search input::placeholder, form.report ::placeholder { color: var(--placeholder); }
.search button, button.btn { font: inherit; font-weight: 500; padding: 12px 20px; border-radius: 2px; border: 0; background: var(--button); color: #fff; cursor: pointer; }
.search button:hover, button.btn:hover { background: var(--button-hover); }
.suggest { position: absolute; top: 100%; left: 0; right: 0; margin-top: 4px; background: #3d4450; border: 1px solid #4b5563; border-radius: var(--radius); overflow: hidden; z-index: 10; box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.5); }
.suggest a { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; padding: 10px 14px; color: var(--ink); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
.suggest a:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
.suggest a:hover, .suggest a.on { background: #5b6575; text-decoration: none; }
.list { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; }
.list li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 120px 1fr; gap: 14px; padding: 12px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); align-items: start; }
.list li img { border-radius: 6px; aspect-ratio: 460 / 215; object-fit: cover; width: 120px; background: var(--soft); }
.list .title { font-weight: 600; color: var(--head); }
.badge { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; padding: 1px 8px; border-radius: 6px; white-space: nowrap; }
.badge.ai { color: var(--ai); background: var(--ai-bg); } .badge.clear { color: var(--clear); background: var(--clear-bg); } .badge.flag { color: var(--flag); background: var(--flag-bg); }
.grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr)); gap: 12px; }
.stat { font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -.01em; color: var(--accent); }
details.faq { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 12px 0; }
details.faq summary { font-weight: 650; cursor: pointer; }
details.faq p { margin: 8px 0 0; }
form.report textarea, form.report input { width: 100%; font: inherit; padding: 10px 12px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); background: var(--field); color: var(--head); margin-bottom: 8px; }
footer.site { background: var(--header); padding: 24px 0 40px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 24px; }
footer.site nav { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 14px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
.verdict .badge { display: inline-block; margin-top: 12px; font-size: 13px; padding: 3px 10px; }
.reqs { font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); }
.reqs.kernel { color: var(--flag); }
.field-label { display: block; font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 4px; }
ul.signals { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; }
ul.signals li { padding: 8px 0 8px 22px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); position: relative; }
ul.signals li::before { content: ""; position: absolute; left: 4px; top: 17px; width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--line); }
ul.signals li.warn::before { background: var(--ai); }
ul.signals li.req::before { background: var(--flag); }
.verdict .reqline { margin: 10px 0 0; font-size: 14px; }
.verdict .reqline a { color: var(--flag); }
.legend { margin-top: 12px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); }
.legend summary { cursor: pointer; }
.legend dl { display: grid; grid-template-columns: max-content 1fr; gap: 6px 14px; margin: 10px 0 0; }
.legend dd { margin: 0; }
.statline { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 12px; margin: 20px 0 0; padding: 14px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
.statline a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
.statline a:hover .stat { text-decoration: underline; }
.statline .stat { font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.2; }
.statline .small { font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; }
.list-intro { margin: 2px 0 0; max-width: 68ch; }
.sr { position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0 0 0 0); white-space: nowrap; }
.crumbs { font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 8px; }
@media (min-width: 720px) {
  h1 { font-size: 36px; }
  .game-head { grid-template-columns: 1fr 300px; }
  .list li { grid-template-columns: 184px 1fr; }
  .list li img { width: 184px; }
}
@media (max-width: 719px) {
  /* Logo on its own row, the nav a scrollable row under it: four links don't fit beside the logo at 390px */
  header.site .wrap { flex-wrap: wrap; height: auto; padding-top: 12px; padding-bottom: 0; row-gap: 0; }
  header nav { margin-left: 0; width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; white-space: nowrap; gap: 8px; scrollbar-width: none; }
  /* 44px tap targets */
  header nav a { padding: 12px 6px; }
  header nav a:first-child { padding-left: 0; }
  .statline .stat { font-size: 20px; }
}
</style><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"ItemList","name":"New Steam releases with AI-generated content","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"url":"https://gameaicheck.com/game/3393110/aion-2","name":"AION 2"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"url":"https://gameaicheck.com/game/4080220/ea-sports-fctm-27","name":"EA SPORTS FC 27"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"url":"https://gameaicheck.com/game/4435490/call-of-duty-modern-warfare-4","name":"Call of Duty: Modern Warfare 4"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":4,"url":"https://gameaicheck.com/game/2887580/active-matter","name":"Active Matter"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":5,"url":"https://gameaicheck.com/game/4252340/cpm-2","name":"CPM 2"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":6,"url":"https://gameaicheck.com/game/1465470/the-crust","name":"The Crust"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":7,"url":"https://gameaicheck.com/game/4954910/scam-with-your-friends","name":"Scam With Your Friends"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":8,"url":"https://gameaicheck.com/game/3985950/r-i-p-reincarnation-insurance-program","name":"R.I.P. - Reincarnation Insurance Program"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":9,"url":"https://gameaicheck.com/game/4356430/nba-2k27","name":"NBA 2K27"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":10,"url":"https://gameaicheck.com/game/4317690/crimson-moon","name":"Crimson Moon"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":11,"url":"https://gameaicheck.com/game/5335510/moon-sweepers","name":"Moon Sweepers"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":12,"url":"https://gameaicheck.com/game/4817620/one-way-tickets","name":"One Way Tickets"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":13,"url":"https://gameaicheck.com/game/4030150/the-legend-of-fancy-realm-remake","name":"The Legend of Fancy Realm Remake"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":14,"url":"https://gameaicheck.com/game/2798330/dungeon-settlers","name":"Dungeon Settlers"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":15,"url":"https://gameaicheck.com/game/5245810/forgetax","name":"ForgeTax"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":16,"url":"https://gameaicheck.com/game/5212940/bunker-tidy-up","name":"Bunker Tidy Up"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":17,"url":"https://gameaicheck.com/game/3531260/superhero-simulator","name":"Superhero Simulator"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":18,"url":"https://gameaicheck.com/game/2010030/denizen","name":"Denizen"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":19,"url":"https://gameaicheck.com/game/2729480/nightclub-simulator","name":"NightClub Simulator"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":20,"url":"https://gameaicheck.com/game/5306540/groundwork-simulator","name":"Groundwork Simulator"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":21,"url":"https://gameaicheck.com/game/3208930/galvatein-adventurers-guild","name":"Galvatein : Adventurers' Guild"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":22,"url":"https://gameaicheck.com/game/3947460/creator-chronicles","name":"Creator Chronicles"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":23,"url":"https://gameaicheck.com/game/5020310/dub-together","name":"Dub Together"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":24,"url":"https://gameaicheck.com/game/4753760/your-fiancee","name":"Your Fiancée"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":25,"url":"https://gameaicheck.com/game/5195600/questaway","name":"QuestAway"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":26,"url":"https://gameaicheck.com/game/5027520/megastore-tidy-up-together","name":"Megastore: Tidy Up Together"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":27,"url":"https://gameaicheck.com/game/4191350/tales-of-fear-episode-zero","name":"Tales of Fear - Episode Zero"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":28,"url":"https://gameaicheck.com/game/4532550/keep-her-safe","name":"Keep Her Safe"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":29,"url":"https://gameaicheck.com/game/3299050/no-such-place","name":"No Such Place"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":30,"url":"https://gameaicheck.com/game/4870960/the-fame-game-ii-l-a-heartbreaker","name":"The Fame Game II: L.A. Heartbreaker"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":31,"url":"https://gameaicheck.com/game/4533490/game","name":"黯渊崛起：魔灵深渊"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":32,"url":"https://gameaicheck.com/game/4072240/woman-simulator","name":"Woman Simulator"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":33,"url":"https://gameaicheck.com/game/4354460/survivor-s-notes","name":"Survivor's Notes"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":34,"url":"https://gameaicheck.com/game/3058360/parisian-bistro-simulator","name":"Parisian Bistro Simulator"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":35,"url":"https://gameaicheck.com/game/5186690/game-keeper-somebody-messed-up-my-shop","name":"Game Keeper: Somebody Messed Up My Shop!"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":36,"url":"https://gameaicheck.com/game/4094660/rivage","name":"Rivage"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":37,"url":"https://gameaicheck.com/game/4753960/meow-squad-incremental-fishing","name":"Meow Squad: Incremental Fishing"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":38,"url":"https://gameaicheck.com/game/5019920/tasty-chef","name":"Tasty Chef"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":39,"url":"https://gameaicheck.com/game/4870430/tidy-up-history","name":"Tidy Up History"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":40,"url":"https://gameaicheck.com/game/4678800/train-sim-world-7","name":"Train Sim World 7"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":41,"url":"https://gameaicheck.com/game/4261320/game","name":"스페셜포스 리마스터"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":42,"url":"https://gameaicheck.com/game/5097840/spellbound-shelved","name":"Spellbound & Shelved"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":43,"url":"https://gameaicheck.com/game/2085660/devices-tycoon","name":"Devices Tycoon"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":44,"url":"https://gameaicheck.com/game/4883590/iracing-studios-nascar-26","name":"iRacing Studios NASCAR 26"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":45,"url":"https://gameaicheck.com/game/4190240/nuclear-design-bureau","name":"Nuclear Design Bureau"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":46,"url":"https://gameaicheck.com/game/2776270/beetleball","name":"Beetleball"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":47,"url":"https://gameaicheck.com/game/4267800/bandit-simulator-td","name":"Bandit Simulator TD"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":48,"url":"https://gameaicheck.com/game/3740090/bruisers-2d-boxing","name":"Bruisers 2D Boxing"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":49,"url":"https://gameaicheck.com/game/4246640/dungeon-brawls","name":"Dungeon Brawls"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":50,"url":"https://gameaicheck.com/game/5099430/the-rhapsody-of-zephyr-remastered","name":"The Rhapsody of Zephyr Remastered"}]}</script></head><body><a class="skip" href="#content">Skip to content</a><header class="site"><div class="wrap"><a class="logo" href="/"><img src="/favicon-48.png" alt="" width="24" height="24"/>Game<span>AI</span>Check</a><nav><a href="/lists">Lists</a><a href="/anti-cheat">Anti-cheat</a><a href="/stats">Stats</a><a href="/sources">How it works</a></nav></div></header><main id="content"><div class="wrap"><div class="crumbs"><a href="/lists">Lists</a> › New Steam releases with AI-generated content</div><h1>New Steam releases with AI-generated content</h1><p class="muted">Games released on Steam in the last 60 days that disclose AI-generated content, most-reviewed first.</p><ul class="list"><li><a href="/game/3393110/aion-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393110/10aa4b096ebe6af0d1dd7882e5ba004271aef6f7/header.jpg?t=1792771538" alt="" loading="lazy" width="184" height="86"/></a><div><a class="title" href="/game/3393110/aion-2">AION 2</a> <span class="badge ai" title="How much of the game is AI-generated, and whether it shows signs of mass production (an AI judgment of the developer&#39;s output, reviews and disclosure)">Partial AI · solid production</span><div class="small muted">5 Oct, 2026 · 41,417 reviews</div><div class="small">Some in-game assets, specifically Arcana card designs and some icons, were made with AI tools.</div></div></li><li><a href="/game/4080220/ea-sports-fctm-27" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080220/ff6a3779f1ca83aae8ad3878454f6c11008ea24d/header.jpg?t=1790973254" alt="" loading="lazy" width="184" height="86"/></a><div><a class="title" href="/game/4080220/ea-sports-fctm-27">EA SPORTS FC 27</a> <span class="badge ai" title="How much of the game is AI-generated, and whether it shows signs of mass production (an AI judgment of the developer&#39;s output, reviews and disclosure)">Partial AI · solid production</span><div class="small muted">24 Sep, 2026 · 10,468 reviews<span class="reqs kernel"> · Kernel anti-cheat</span></div><div class="small">The developer discloses that generative AI may have been used for some pre-rendered or live-generated content, within a human-led process.</div></div></li><li><a href="/game/4435490/call-of-duty-modern-warfare-4" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4435490/0c492be3204835d71e8b454b6eb1817f8ff68c0d/header.jpg?t=1793201144" alt="" loading="lazy" width="184" height="86"/></a><div><a class="title" href="/game/4435490/call-of-duty-modern-warfare-4">Call of Duty: Modern Warfare 4</a> <span class="badge ai" title="How much of the game is AI-generated, and whether it shows signs of mass production (an AI judgment of the developer&#39;s output, reviews and disclosure)">Partial AI · solid production</span><div class="small muted">22 Oct, 2026 · 9,826 reviews<span class="reqs kernel"> · Kernel anti-cheat</span></div><div class="small">The developer says generative AI tools helped create some in-game assets; most of the game appears made by people.</div></div></li><li><a href="/game/2887580/active-matter" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887580/191801a8de4db48075ef195473a922391cb4c6de/header.jpg?t=1793032833" alt="" loading="lazy" width="184" height="86"/></a><div><a class="title" href="/game/2887580/active-matter">Active Matter</a> <span class="badge ai" title="How much of the game is AI-generated, and whether it shows signs of mass production (an AI judgment of the developer&#39;s output, reviews and disclosure)">Minor AI · solid production</span><div class="small muted">15 Sep, 2026 · 4,167 reviews<span class="reqs kernel"> · Kernel anti-cheat</span></div><div class="small">An in-game AI character&#39;s voice is AI-generated; the rest of the game appears human-made.</div></div></li><li><a href="/game/4252340/cpm-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252340/f712f104515ff0af8e05be7afd75f30eb092cd58/header.jpg?t=1791484313" alt="" loading="lazy" width="184" height="86"/></a><div><a class="title" href="/game/4252340/cpm-2">CPM 2</a> <span class="badge ai" title="How much of the game is AI-generated, and whether it shows signs of mass production (an AI judgment of the developer&#39;s output, reviews and disclosure)">Partial AI · solid production</span><div class="small muted">8 Oct, 2026 · 4,151 reviews<span class="reqs"> · Google Firebase</span></div><div class="small">AI was used for loading screens, promo banners, text translation, and the announcer&#39;s voice; 3D cars, tuning, and the open world are hand-made.</div></div></li><li><a href="/game/1465470/the-crust" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1465470/7458a8b466e5b906e4ddf1a13a0d0c0c6fb65d37/header_alt_assets_18.jpg?t=1791564122" alt="" loading="lazy" width="184" height="86"/></a><div><a class="title" href="/game/1465470/the-crust">The Crust</a> <span class="badge ai" title="How much of the game is AI-generated, and whether it shows signs of mass production (an AI judgment of the developer&#39;s output, reviews and disclosure)">Partial AI · solid production</span><div class="small muted">10 Sep, 2026 · 3,929 reviews</div><div class="small">Some in-game textures and company logos w