lt="" loading="lazy" width="184" height="86"/></a><div><a class="title" href="/game/4301110/the-headlands">The Headlands</a> <span class="badge ai" title="How much of the game is AI-generated, and whether it shows signs of mass production (an AI judgment of the developer&#39;s output, reviews and disclosure)">Minor AI · solid production</span><div class="small muted">14 Sep, 2026 · 220 reviews</div><div class="small">Some contract illustrations are AI-assisted; the developer says they&#39;re illustrative only and will be replaced with hand-drawn art.</div></div></li><li><a href="/game/4328570/we-are-football-2027" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4328570/1d3ac8128f0cf954b90c07176a18a45f0b7b142e/header.jpg?t=1791985731" alt="" loading="lazy" width="184" height="86"/></a><div><a class="title" href="/game/4328570/we-are-football-2027">WE ARE FOOTBALL 2027</a> <span class="badge ai" title="How much of the game is AI-generated, and whether it shows signs of mass production (an AI judgment of the developer&#39;s output, reviews and disclosure)">Partial AI · solid production</span><div class="small muted">16 Sep, 2026 · 215 reviews</div><div class="small">About 12,500 AI-generated player photos appear on line-up and profile screens; the rest of the management sim is human-made.</div></div></li><li><a href="/game/3544130/soul-chained" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/c3b1f93dbe24f30c7ffc596cea30b922f02edeab/header.jpg?t=1789489864" alt="" loading="lazy" width="184" height="86"/></a><div><a class="title" href="/game/3544130/soul-chained">Soul Chained</a> <span class="badge ai" title="How much of the game is AI-generated, and whether it shows signs of mass production (an AI judgment of the developer&#39;s output, reviews and disclosure)">Minor AI · solid production</span><div class="small muted">7 Sep, 2026 · 215 reviews</div><div class="small">Some minor sound effects were AI-generated and are being replaced; the rest of the game appears human-made.</div></div></li><li><a href="/game/4152550/eggstreme-farming" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152550/d7c213fb8ec187852c59fafee347fcc804a17fae/header.jpg?t=1788533341" alt="" loading="lazy" width="184" height="86"/></a><div><a class="title" href="/game/4152550/eggstreme-farming">Eggstreme Farming</a> <span class="badge ai" title="How much of the game is AI-generated, and whether it shows signs of mass production (an AI judgment of the developer&#39;s output, reviews and disclosure)">Minor AI · solid production</span><div class="small muted">4 Sep, 2026 · 211 reviews</div><div class="small">AI was used for promotional and cover artwork, achievement icons, marketing materials, and parts of the translations; in-game content is otherwise human-made.</div></div></li><li><a href="/game/3154800/football-pitch-simulator" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154800/5889685841bf138c6bda4be8ace5412a42324fea/header.jpg?t=1792676183" alt="" loading="lazy" width="184" height="86"/></a><div><a class="title" href="/game/3154800/football-pitch-simulator">Football Pitch Simulator</a> <span class="badge ai" title="How much of the game is AI-generated, and whether it shows signs of mass production (an AI judgment of the developer&#39;s output, reviews and disclosure)">Partial AI · solid production</span><div class="small muted">22 Oct, 2026 · 211 reviews</div><div class="small">AI was used for store capsules and logos and for voice acting in trainer and customer dialogues; other assets appear human-made.</div></div></li><li><a href="/game/5001630/jiahao" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5001630/65eb2c000979c01229bd73139b06a0921a5c3d31/header.jpg?t=1790434273" alt="" loading="lazy" width="184" height="86"/></a><div><a class="title" href="/game/5001630/jiahao">Jiahao</a> <span class="badge ai" title="How much of the game is AI-generated, and whether it shows signs of mass production (an AI judgment of the developer&#39;s output, reviews and disclosure)">Major AI · solid production</span><div class="small muted">9 Sep, 2026 · 210 reviews</div><div class="small">Character art, animation frames, UI and item icons, voice lines, and promotional artwork were made or refined with generative AI tools.</div></div></li><li><a href="/game/5130480/sort-the-capybaras" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5130480/13edff66f11240d5fcb217805745d0473a174a7f/header.jpg?t=1792124765" alt="" loading="lazy" width="184" height="86"/></a><div><a class="title" href="/game/5130480/sort-the-capybaras">Sort The Capybaras</a> <span class="badge ai" title="How much of the game is AI-generated, and whether it shows signs of mass production (an AI judgment of the developer&#39;s output, reviews and disclosure)">Partial AI · solid production</span><div class="small muted">8 Oct, 2026 · 205 reviews</div><div class="small">Uses AI support to craft and edit some of the game&#39;s 3D model meshes, alongside human-designed toys and models.</div></div></li><li><a href="/game/4240610/code-velocity" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4240610/e4a647dd2e3645d2195f468704d0b08e27bffff7/header.jpg?t=1789541936" alt="" loading="lazy" width="184" height="86"/></a><div><a class="title" href="/game/4240610/code-velocity">Code Velocity</a> <span class="badge ai" title="How much of the game is AI-generated, and whether it shows signs of mass production (an AI judgment of the developer&#39;s output, reviews and disclosure)">Partial AI · solid production</span><div class="small muted">15 Sep, 2026 · 199 reviews</div><div class="small">Some characters and scenes in this game are AI-generated, per the developer&#39;s disclosure; most assets appear human-made.</div></div></li><li><a href="/game/4221990/fish-lab" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221990/dcbb43f81e7d2bf1d7c89438c34195cbe45b38b1/header.jpg?t=1789401717" alt="" loading="lazy" width="184" height="86"/></a><div><a class="title" href="/game/4221990/fish-lab">Fish Lab</a> <span class="badge ai" title="How much of the game is AI-generated, and whether it shows signs of mass production (an AI judgment of the developer&#39;s output, reviews and disclosure)">Minor AI · solid production</span><div class="small muted">14 Sep, 2026 · 198 reviews</div><div class="small">AI is used only for translating some text; images and music were made by hand.</div></div></li><li><a href="/game/3484100/bait-soul" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484100/84157cba842ddaad7684feed3c7bb9fd342ff86f/header.jpg?t=1793105555" alt="" loading="lazy" width="184" height="86"/></a><div><a class="title" href="/game/3484100/bait-soul">Bait Soul</a> <span class="badge ai" title="How much of the game is AI-generated, and whether it shows signs of mass production (an AI judgment of the developer&#39;s output, reviews and disclosure)">Minor AI · solid production</span><div class="small muted">22 Sep, 2026 · 190 reviews</div><div class="small">Some background music was generated with AI tools; the rest of the game appears human-made.</div></div></li><li><a href="/game/3353800/golden-swirl" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353800/d8c3c5c4e5d7545e1862643acb6c72d0ee2819de/header.jpg?t=1793006647" alt="" loading="lazy" width="184" height="86"/></a><div><a class="title" href="/game/3353800/golden-swirl">Golden Swirl</a> <span class="badge ai" title="How much of the game is AI-generated, and whether it shows signs of mass production (an AI judgment of the developer&#39;s output, reviews and disclosure)">Minor AI · solid production</span><div class="small muted">9 Sep, 2026 · 190 reviews</div><div class="small">A few small draft icons from early development are AI-generated, with the developer planning to replace them.</div></div></li><li><a href="/game/3746950/life-the-universe-and-restaurants" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746950/504f782986861f4711a049466c364aeff3b8eec8/header.jpg?t=1791803615" alt="" loading="lazy" width="184" height="86"/></a><div><a class="title" href="/game/3746950/life-the-universe-and-restaurants">Life, the Universe, and Restaurants</a> <span class="badge ai" title="How much of the game is AI-generated, and whether it shows signs of mass production (an AI judgment of the developer&#39;s output, reviews and disclosure)">Partial AI · solid production</span><div class="small muted">12 Oct, 2026 · 177 reviews</div><div class="small">AI was used for a small portion of textures and the main menu background; the rest of the game is human-made.</div></div></li><li><a href="/game/3982450/hitler-waifu-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982450/d38cd4b83187f8bbb30134bda1fcc3885bd45cad/header.jpg?t=1793144670" alt="" loading="lazy" width="184" height="86"/></a><div><a class="title" href="/game/3982450/hitler-waifu-2">HITLER WAIFU 2</a> <span class="badge ai" title="How much of the game is AI-generated, and whether it shows signs of mass production (an AI judgment of the developer&#39;s output, reviews and disclosure)">Major AI · solid production</span><div class="small muted">27 Oct, 2026 · 169 reviews</div><div class="small">The developer discloses that in-game voice acting and images were AI-generated.</div></div></li><li><a href="/game/5070160/wuwei-cultivation" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5070160/7500ae85c95ad763541c13ff83b74b6f02040ecc/header.jpg?t=1788759234" alt="" loading="lazy" width="184" height="86"/></a><div><a class="title" href="/game/5070160/wuwei-cultivation">Wuwei Cultivation</a> <span class="badge ai" title="How much of the game is AI-generated, and whether it shows signs of mass production (an AI judgment of the developer&#39;s output, reviews and disclosure)">Partial AI · solid production</span><div class="small muted">1 Sep, 2026 · 167 reviews</div><div class="small">The developer says some in-game art and content is AI-generated, with human review and adjustment.</div></div></li><li><a href="/game/4809400/longevity-path-of-the-immortal" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809400/99aa5a1216c8d55d8f68849ad5490104ed30acf3/header.jpg?t=1788512177" alt="" loading="lazy" width="184" height="86"/></a><div><a class="title" href="/game/4809400/longevity-path-of-the-immortal">Longevity: Path of the Immortal</a> <span class="badge ai" title="How much of the game is AI-generated, and whether it shows signs of mass production (an AI judgment of the developer&#39;s output, reviews and disclosure)">Minor AI · solid production</span><div class="small muted">4 Sep, 2026 · 165 reviews</div><div class="small">The developer says some store page materials include AI-generated elements; no in-game AI content is disclosed.</div></div></li><li><a href="/game/1473260/black-gold-oil-drilling-simulator" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473260/e405ba031c525651d7aad0b0218cb2cc7cb1509f/header_alt_assets_2.jpg?t=1792414442" alt="" loading="lazy" width="184" height="86"/></a><div><a class="title" href="/game/1473260/black-gold-oil-drilling-simulator">Black Gold: Oil Drilling Simulator</a> <span class="badge ai" title="How much of the game is AI-generated, and whether it shows signs of mass production (an AI judgment of the developer&#39;s output, reviews and disclosure)">Minor AI · solid production</span><div class="small muted">10 Sep, 2026 · 165 reviews</div><div class="small">Some demo voiceovers and advertising materials were AI-generated; the rest of the game appears human-made.</div></div></li><li><a href="/game/4771880/three-kingdoms-yi" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771880/f9cd4fc310adb9834bc84a32a1f49dffd322b379/header.jpg?t=1792884503" alt="" loading="lazy" width="184" height="86"/></a><div><a class="title" href="/game/4771880/three-kingdoms-yi">Three Kingdoms:Yi</a> <span class="badge ai" title="How much of the game is AI-generated, and whether it shows signs of mass production (an AI judgment of the developer&#39;s output, reviews and disclosure)">Partial AI · solid production</span><div class="small muted">22 Oct, 2026 · 162 reviews</div><div class="small">Character illustrations, music, and sound effects were drafted with AI tools, then manually revised; gameplay, story, and writing are developer-made.</div></div></li><li><a href="/game/3062500/the-adventurers" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062500/e2cbb9cefca6a72a8eded824f172ac5050d6845a/header.jpg?t=1788186695" alt="" loading="lazy" width="184" height="86"/></a><div><a class="title" href="/game/3062500/the-adventurers">The Adventurers</a> <span class="badge ai" title="How much of the game is AI-generated, and whether it shows signs of mass production (an AI judgment of the developer&#39;s output, reviews and disclosure)">Minor AI · solid production</span><div class="small muted">31 Aug, 2026 · 162 reviews</div><div class="small">An AI narrator voices event-related text for accessibility; the rest of the game appears human-made.</div></div></li><li><a href="/game/4285110/tunnel-escape-fates-entwined" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4285110/141ce1d92ad831d9446487bd67e9d96a953c9bbf/header.jpg?t=1791812636" alt="" loading="lazy" width="184" height="86"/></a><div><a class="title" href="/game/4285110/tunnel-escape-fates-entwined">Tunnel Escape Fates Entwined</a> <span class="badge ai" title="How much of the game is AI-generated, and whether it shows signs of mass production (an AI judgment of the developer&#39;s output, reviews and disclosure)">Partial AI · solid production</span><div class="small muted">2 Oct, 2026 · 158 reviews</div><div class="small">AI was used to help create some of the game&#39;s background images; the rest appears human-made.</div></div></li></ul><details class="legend"><summary>What the labels mean</summary><dl><dt>Minor / Partial / Major AI, AI-driven</dt><dd>How much of the game is AI-generated, from the developer&#39;s disclosure.</dd><dt>solid production · mixed signals · mass-produced signs</dt><dd>Whether the game looks carefully made, from the developer&#39;s release pace, player reviews and the disclosure. An AI judgment, not a verdict.</dd><dt>No AI disclosure</dt><dd>The developer hasn&#39;t declared AI use on Steam. That isn&#39;t proof the game uses none.</dd><dt>Flagged, not disclosed</dt><dd>Steam curators say the game uses AI its store page doesn&#39;t disclose.</dd></dl><p style="margin:8px 0 0"><a href="/sources">How we check →</a></p></details></div></main><footer class="site"><div class="wrap"><nav><a href="/">Search</a><a href="/lists">Lists</a><a href="/anti-cheat">Anti-cheat &amp; accounts</a><a href="/stats">Stats</a><a href="/sources">Sources &amp; method</a><a href="/about">About</a><a href="/contact">Contact / disputes</a></nav><p>Data from public Steam store pages, Steam curators and open-source tools. Not affiliated with Valve or Steam.</p></div></footer><script>
(() => {
  const input = document.querySelector('[data-search]');
  if (!input) return;
  const box = document.createElement('div'); box.className = 'suggest'; box.hidden = true;
  box.id = 'suggest'; box.setAttribute('role', 'listbox');
  const live = document.createElement('div'); live.className = 'sr'; live.setAttribute('aria-live', 'polite');
  input.parentElement.append(box, live);
  input.setAttribute('role', 'combobox'); input.setAttribute('aria-controls', 'suggest');
  input.setAttribute('aria-autocomplete', 'list'); input.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');
  const show = (on) => { box.hidden = !on; input.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(on)); if (!on) input.removeAttribute('aria-activedescendant'); };
  let t, idx = -1;
  const label = (g) => g.has_ai ? '<span class="badge ai">AI disclosed</span>' : g.undisclosed ? '<span class="badge flag">Flagged</span>' : '<span class="badge clear">No AI disclosure</span>';
  const esc = (s) => s.replace(/[&<>"]/g, (c) => ({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;'}[c]));
  input.addEventListener('input', () => {
    clearTimeout(t);
    const q = input.value.trim();
    if (q.length < 2) { show(false); return; }
    t = setTimeout(async () => {
      const r = await fetch('/api/search?q=' + encodeURIComponent(q));
      const games = await r.json();
      idx = -1;
      box.innerHTML = games.map((g, i) => '<a role="option" id="sg' + i + '" href="' + g.url + '"><span>' + esc(g.name) + '</span>' + label(g) + '</a>').join('');
      show(games.length > 0);
      live.textContent = games.length ? games.length + ' suggestions, use arrow keys' : 'No matching games';
    }, 150);
  });
  input.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
    if (e.key === 'Escape') { show(false); return; }
    const items = [...box.querySelectorAll('a')];
    if (!items.length || box.hidden) return;
    if (e.key === 'ArrowDown' || e.key === 'ArrowUp') {
      e.preventDefault();
      idx = (idx + (e.key === 'ArrowDown' ? 1 : -1) + items.length) % items.length;
      items.forEach((a, i) => { a.classList.toggle('on', i === idx); a.setAttribute('aria-selected', String(i === idx)); });
      input.setAttribute('aria-activedescendant', items[idx].id);
    } else if (e.key === 'Enter' && idx >= 0) { e.preventDefault(); location.href = items[idx].href; }
  });
  document.addEventListener('click', (e) => { if (!input.parentElement.contains(e.target)) show(false); });
})();
</script><script type="module" src="https://static.cloudflareinsights.com/beacon.min.js" data-cf-beacon="{&quot;token&quot;: &quot;a941fdedbf5e467c8766d72c46b1b799&quot;}"></script></body></html>